 "decision": "The OOS stability statistic becomes a stress-overlap jackknife: max-dev-from-median is computed over all folds; if the argmax-deviation fold's test window overlaps a full_series stress window judged GO under carry semantics, that SINGLE fold is excluded and the statistic is recomputed over the remaining folds (median re-derived). At most one fold is excluded per statistic. The per-fold absolute bounds apply to the eligible folds; the excluded fold's realized risk is judged by the stress gate (no double counting of the same event by two gates with different semantics). The excluded fold is reported in full as a diagnostic.",
